[{"answer":"Hi Shannon, how are you settling into your new flat?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Really well, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You look like you're going shopping.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"My cousins are coming to stay for a couple of days, and I have to cook for them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there are plenty of places to buy food in Kite Place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"it's the area by the harbour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, okay, I'll find that on the map.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of food do you need to get?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, neither of them eats meat but they both like fish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's a really good fish market there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Where is it exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/14_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's at the far end of Kite Place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"so you have to go over the bridge and then it's on the right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, is it open all day?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't close until four,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'd recommend going earlier than that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"it does run out of some things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I don't want that to happen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"As long as you get there by 3:30, you should be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's only 11 now, so plenty of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you need to buy vegetables too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I do, and I want to avoid all the plastic packaging in the supermarket!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's a really nice organic shop there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what's it called...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the name of a flower.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I know, it's 'Rose'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's a nice name.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, it sells vegetables and quite a lot of other stuff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And where's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as you reach the market,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll see a big grey building on your left,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it used to be a warehouse.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, now it's a restaurant upstairs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but the ground floor has two shops either side of the entrance and it's the one on the left.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's easy enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/39_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You can't miss it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"there's also a big sign on the pavement so you can look for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess if I need anything else, I'll have to go to the supermarket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, you should be able to get everything you need,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but there's a minibus that goes to the supermarket if you need it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's purple and the number is 289.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, that's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So what do you need to get at the fish market?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The salmon is always very good and the shellfish...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm going to make a curry, I think,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I need about 12 prawns for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll have plenty of those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you ever tried samphire?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No, what's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a type of seaweed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I just ask for a handful and you fry it in butter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's delicious!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I might try that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"how do you spell it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's SAMPHIRE.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Great! It's always good to try something different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll see what beans they have in the organic shop","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think I'll get something for dessert there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"How about a mango?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure, they're not always ripe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/65-2024-07-09-11-37-51.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd prefer a melon, it's bigger too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/67_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"The owner also sells a lot of spices there that you can put in a curry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/68_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and things like coconut.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/69_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's very helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/70_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll have a look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/71_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/72_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I know bread doesn't really go with curry","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/73_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but I always like to have some in case.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/74_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"As I said, all the bread is home-made and there's lots of variety.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/75_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the brown bread myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/76_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Mm, sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/77_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They sell other things there too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/78_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Like cakes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/79_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I love chocolate cake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/80_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, not that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/81_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but they have a whole range of tarts","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/82_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and the best are the strawberry ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/83_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Perfect!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/84_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hopefully I won't even have to go to the supermarket!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-1-2024-06-22-00-23-25/85_v3.mp3"}]
